#: src-en/data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml:20
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml$//event[@name=\"START_BEACON_AEA_OLD_1\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"你迷迷糊糊地从地上爬起来。舰船摄像头显示，其他大多数船员也正做着同样的事，从"
"沉睡中醒来。你记得自己刚才还在与那艘奇怪的飞船交战，但此刻你发现自己已不再受"
"到攻击。此外，一个未知的联络人正在呼叫你。"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml:27
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml$//event[@name=\"START_BEACON_AEA_OLD_1\"]/choice[@req=\"ANCIENT_ACTIVATOR\""
" and not(@lvl)]/text"
msgstr "接听呼叫。"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml:29
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml$//event[@name=\"START_BEACON_AEA_OLD_1\"]/choice[@req=\"ANCIENT_ACTIVATOR\""
" and not(@lvl)]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"正当你准备接听呼叫时，你意识到那个一直在你船上休眠的远古外星人已经消失了。\n"
"屏幕上出现了一个奇特的物种。“欢迎来到穹界。不幸的是，你偶然发现了一些不该看到"
"的东西，所以我们把你带到了这里，你将在流放中度过余生。”"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml:34
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml$//event[@name=\"START_BEACON_AEA_OLD_1\"]/choice[@req=\"ANCIENT_ACTIVATOR\""
" and not(@lvl)]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "什么？"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml:36
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml$//event[@name=\"START_BEACON_AEA_OLD_1\"]/choice[@req=\"ANCIENT_ACTIVATOR\""
" and not(@lvl)]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"“我想解释一下也无妨。你是想听个简短的版本，还是想知道你为何在此的详细说明？”"
"\n"
"（省流：以前利尔米克族很NB，随着时间逐渐衰弱，内战后将自己隔离起来，清除发现"
"此种族的人。）"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml:38
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_aea_old_1.xml$//event[@name=\"START_BEACON_AEA_OLD_1\"]/choice[@req=\"ANCIENT_ACTIVATOR\""
" and not(@lvl)]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "长篇版本。"

